	<ThingDef ParentName="MealBase">
		<defName>HeadcrabGrill</defName>
		<label>Headcrab Grill</label>
		<description>So, you have a headcrab. And you have a grill. What could possibly go wrong? Answer: everything. But if you close your eyes and think happy thoughts, headcrab meat tastes like something between calamari and the sole of an old boot. The secret ingredient is serving it with lots of alcohol and complete denial that you ever did this. Tastes like victory over an alien parasite. With a hint of bitterness.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Item/Meal/Headcrab</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>1</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
